  "notes": "Fresh-state Nine Ball lock-lane probe. A coin and the credit button start a game with three balls in the trough, and the serve is modelled by the trough switches and the shooter lane 40. Objects 1-4 are made in order; each time the ROM pulses the eight-bank reset (17) the scenario opens every target that is down, standing in for the bank rising, and answers each knock-down coil the ROM then fires by closing that target's switch. With object 5 lit, ball 1 enters the left-lane kick-out hole (34); ball 2 is served and stops on the lane's middle switch (38), ball 3 on its top switch (39), and each spot and release the ROM performs is answered the same way. A coil the ROM does not fire in the expected order ends the run with a timeout.",
